sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Staff user
    participant FE as React AI page
    participant API as FastAPI /api/ai
    participant AS as ai_service.py
    participant RS as report_service.py
    participant DB as SQLAlchemy database
    participant PROVIDER as Configured AI provider

    U->>FE: enter a business question
    FE->>API: POST /api/ai/chat with query
    API->>AS: answer_query(db, current_user, query)
    AS->>RS: build_business_snapshot(db)
    RS->>DB: read orders, products, customers and expenses
    DB-->>RS: current business records
    RS-->>AS: structured business snapshot

    alt AI provider is configured and responds
        AS->>PROVIDER: send question and structured snapshot
        PROVIDER-->>AS: grounded language answer
    else provider unavailable or not configured
        AS->>AS: use keyword-based fallback answer
    end

    AS->>DB: INSERT ai_queries with question and answer
    AS->>DB: COMMIT
    AS-->>API: AIQueryResponse
    API-->>FE: 200 answer
    FE-->>U: display answer